  "details": "<p>According to Ball, the site dates to the Kushan and Hepthalo-Turk period (first to ninth century AD). Ceramics of the Timurid period (15th-16th century) are also in evidence. The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Qal'a-i Zal, AFG</p>",
